{"product_id":"vaporesso-euc-universal-ceramic-coil","title":"Vaporesso EUC Universal Coil (5-Pack)","description":"\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThe Vaporesso EUC Replacement Coils (EUC - Eco Universal Coil) is an innovative performance atomizer created with affordability in mind. It is intuitive created, changing the way users typically replacement the atomizer coils. Instead of changing the entire coils, the EUC Replacement Coils only requires the changing of the core instead of the entire metal sleeve. The result is a more cost-effective design, while providing ample performance capability. There are two types of version, a Ceramic type that pays homage to the original cCell structures and a Traditional performance coil, with Kanthal, Nickel, or Stainless Steel heating elements.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThese coils are smaller than others, this is through design and they help reduce waste - while still conducting heat and absorbing eliquid efficiently, the ceramic wick also increases the lifespan of your coils. For best results, tthese coils should be paired with high VG e-liquids that are 60% VG or higher.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eCompatibility:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eAttitude Tank - part of Attitude Kit\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eVeco Tank - part of Tarot Nano Kit\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eEstoc Tank\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eVaporesso EUC Ceramic Coils are for use with the Veco Vape Tank and Estoc Vape Tank. EUC Ceramic Coils are available in 0.5 Ohm. With ceramic wicks rather than the traditional cotton, they are similar in design to the Vaporesso CCELL Coils.\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eContains:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e5 x Vaporesso EUC Replacement Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"EUC - Ceramic 0.5ohm","offer_id":41990945865783,"sku":"V EUC Universal Ceramic Coil (5-Pack)-2","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"EUC - Traditional 0.4ohm","offer_id":41990945898551,"sku":"V EUC Universal Ceramic Coil (5-Pack)-1","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Vaporesso-EUC-Universal-Ceramic-Coil.jpg?v=1763426268","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-euc-universal-ceramic-coil","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




